<title>USA: Menomonie, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</title>
<headline>Menomonie, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $2.655 million of Menomonie, Wis., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
</text>
